                                "sense_id": "3109e7bf-09f3-3e59-b23b-7782dc936a62",
                                "text": "[…] their roots, projecting in fibrous sprawls from their trunks, were their feet, and she pictured them advancing with wide trailings, and rustlings as of green draperies […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "548112ab-3cfc-42cc-ade7-32347d070c35",
                                "sense_id": "3109e7bf-09f3-3e59-b23b-7782dc936a62",
                                "text": "All too often, the spout of a soap dispenser rests over the counter and leaves trailings of soap that must be wiped up frequently if a clean appearance is to be maintained."
                            }
                        ]
